      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIC JAKE (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 6 lengths at Angle Park in a handy 31.46. Nicely placed here on the inside and has a good record over this journey. Has hit winning form and can go on with it. RIBERY (3) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 4.5 lengths at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 19.65 beating Riverside Beast. Fair draw can see a good run and in form and has the ability. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Looks a key chance if runs up to latest figure. MOLLEY MACALLAN (7) generally flies the lids but last time was always well back and ran below best, finishing seventh (31.63) in a Special conditions race at Angle Park. Fast away and won (31.63) at Angle Park the start prior. Has a strong winning record at this journey. Better than last start and can bounce back. SOKAI (6) was in the money last time at Murray Bridge (25.91) in a Grade 6, finishing a 3 length second. Already a winner from this draw.",
